1
00:00:00,370 --> 00:00:01,450
Umur 40 ke atas?

2
00:00:01,650 --> 00:00:03,470
Mata nampak okay,

3
00:00:03,630 --> 00:00:05,350
pandangan pun okay?

4
00:00:05,470 --> 00:00:06,230
Tunggu dulu.

5
00:00:06,670 --> 00:00:09,050
Ada satu penyakit mata namanya glaukoma,

6
00:00:09,150 --> 00:00:11,000
iaitu kerosakan pada saraf

7
00:00:11,070 --> 00:00:13,970
yang hantar gambar dari mata ke otak.

8
00:00:14,230 --> 00:00:15,100
Pakar Sunway cakap,

9
00:00:15,150 --> 00:00:16,850
sehingga 40 peratus penglihatan

10
00:00:16,890 --> 00:00:18,700
boleh hilang tanpa kita sedar

11
00:00:18,770 --> 00:00:21,450
sebab ia mula dari penglihatan tepi,

12
00:00:21,850 --> 00:00:23,750
jadi pandangan depan nampak normal.

13
00:00:23,810 --> 00:00:24,750
Tiada sakit.

14
00:00:24,790 --> 00:00:25,510
Tiada tanda.

15
00:00:25,530 --> 00:00:27,650
Dan bila dah hilang,

16
00:00:27,810 --> 00:00:29,950
tak boleh dipulihkan semula.

17
00:00:30,010 --> 00:00:31,950
Rawatan hanya boleh halang

18
00:00:31,970 --> 00:00:33,890
ia jadi lebih teruk.

19
00:00:34,030 --> 00:00:35,850
Di Malaysia, glaukoma

20
00:00:35,950 --> 00:00:38,100
ialah punca ketiga kebutaan.

21
00:00:38,170 --> 00:00:40,100
Dan menurut WHO,

22
00:00:40,210 --> 00:00:42,450
lebih separuh kes

23
00:00:42,510 --> 00:00:44,090
dikesan lewat.

24
00:00:44,650 --> 00:00:46,850
Cara tahu cuma satu sahaja.

25
00:00:47,170 --> 00:00:49,100
Periksa mata, jangan

26
00:00:49,170 --> 00:00:50,530
tunggu rasa sakit,

27
00:00:50,550 --> 00:00:52,800
sebab glaukoma memang tak rasa sakit.

28
00:00:52,850 --> 00:00:54,450
Booking dulu minggu ni.

29
00:00:54,600 --> 00:00:56,050
Untuk sokongan harian,

30
00:00:56,100 --> 00:00:57,150
DS Pharma Eye Care,

31
00:00:57,180 --> 00:00:58,800
berdaftar MAL22076147T,

32
00:00:59,040 --> 00:01:01,540
digunakan secara tradisional untuk kesihatan mata.

33
00:01:01,880 --> 00:01:03,300
Bukan rawatan penyakit mata

34
00:01:03,320 --> 00:01:05,420
dan bukan ganti pemeriksaan.

35
00:01:05,600 --> 00:01:08,160
So, jumpa lagi dekat DS Pharma Eye Care.
